{"about_the_game":"Set in an era when electricity wasn\u2019t a thing and nothing but imaginations of great inventors that set the world in motion, LIT test your own inner engineer and lets you discover the joy of experimenting with light at first hand.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1190160/extras/17d77e0dacb33ac0f8501a841b2d6ccf.poster.avif?t=1695457269\" width=736 height=148 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1190160/extras/17d77e0dacb33ac0f8501a841b2d6ccf.webm?t=1695457269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1190160/extras/17d77e0dacb33ac0f8501a841b2d6ccf.mp4?t=1695457269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1190160/extras/db54f9c73b1ef83d45f3346a1759a0eb.webp?t=1695457269\" width=633 height=50 /></span><br>The behaviour of light in LIT is physically accurate. That said, the amazing light paths you are going to build in LIT are possible but extremely hard to reproduce in real life. Our game gives you the opportunity to set up mirrors and glass pieces to reflect and refract a light beam as you wish, with just few clicks of the mouse.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1190160/extras/6fc092e9295c91d5c6b1c827805c7cf7.webp?t=1695457269\" width=633 height=50 /></span><br>Our puzzles are open-ended. We give you the rules and the tools, you show us how to solve the problem. We assigned a number of possible solutions to each level but don\u2019t let those numbers fool you -  we\u2019re only waiting for the players to find solutions we haven't thought of.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1190160/extras/da1c0bc7453f2aa0d9dc495ab470d323.webp?t=1695457269\" width=633 height=50 /></span><br>Visuals threading on the thin line between cartoony and realistic. Good pacing. Relaxing music, which lets you zone in. All of that creates a unique, mysterious but warm atmosphere.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1190160/extras/cb5e402ec5a9e29820a8a30abaa659fa.poster.avif?t=1695457269\" width=736 height=148 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1190160/extras/cb5e402ec5a9e29820a8a30abaa659fa.webm?t=1695457269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1190160/extras/cb5e402ec5a9e29820a8a30abaa659fa.mp4?t=1695457269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1190160/extras/259229fdf3c93f5324a421f94aa04505.webp?t=1695457269\" width=633 height=50 /></span><br>When light hits a mirror and it reflects, it hits glass and it bends. That\u2019s all. And yet, it offers thousands of possibilities, which means each of our levels is different and unique.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1190160/extras/225a006ca581bf0521af623081891fad.webp?t=1695457269\" width=633 height=50 /></span><br>LIT is extremely intuitive. Testing the game on multiple gaming events proved that it works for all age groups and all types of players. You want to find every solution and beyond? Searching for a game for your 5-year-old? Or maybe you\u2019re trying to introduce your mum to gaming? Controller player or mouse and keyboard type, LIT\u2019s got you covered.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"2b6193c813f4f030c18b9aa767c4c0c5034f34d3.jpg","localized_name":"Engineer Apprentice","name":"Engineer Apprentice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1190160/2b6193c813f4f030c18b9aa767c4c0c5034f34d3.jpg"},{"icon":"05e8ca447ba9e35ef1c14bf21c6a2f367ed7210f.jpg","localized_name":"Novice Engineer","name":"Novice Engineer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1190160/05e8ca447ba9e35ef1c14bf21c6a2f367ed7210f.jpg"},{"icon":"b30e1d32426fd0c680296ff3363643d4b4cf9512.jpg","localized_name":"Proficient Engineer","name":"Proficient Engineer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1190160/b30e1d32426fd0c680296ff3363643d4b4cf9512.jpg"},{"icon":"976c6bf1d98b0ba2716f1dd04ea2750b674f27a7.jpg","localized_name":" Experienced Engineer","name":" Experienced Engineer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1190160/976c6bf1d98b0ba2716f1dd04ea2750b674f27a7.jpg"},{"icon":"385d2da64fe9f449cfe3aa2b17c7cb2b9d841bec.jpg","localized_name":" Expert Engineer","name":" Expert Engineer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1190160/385d2da64fe9f449cfe3aa2b17c7cb2b9d841bec.jpg"},{"icon":"a13f065c75785b0a4d9c4f810376c90248cae154.jpg","localized_name":" You Should be the Game Designer","name":" You Should be the Game Designer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1190160/a13f065c75785b0a4d9c4f810376c90248cae154.jpg"},{"icon":"2f96365fc071daaeff37f88d7c24b237e8deb2d9.jpg","localized_name":"Ugly Mugs","name":"Ugly Mugs","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1190160/2f96365fc071daaeff37f88d7c24b237e8deb2d9.jpg"},{"icon":"d84400917725ea06c8ffc6d6791d221f538475d1.jpg","localized_name":"Fair Enough","name":"Fair Enough","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1190160/d84400917725ea06c8ffc6d6791d221f538475d1.jpg"},{"icon":"7df984a0ff1a8487b9a28fe6b6e6edcc57b57b56.jpg","localized_name":"That\u2019s All You\u2019ve Got?","name":"That\u2019s All You\u2019ve Got?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1190160/7df984a0ff1a8487b9a28fe6b6e6edcc57b57b56.jpg"},{"icon":"236d616dc6518d743846a3aa2377475e4f12b60a.jpg","localized_name":"Bouncy Business","name":"Bouncy Business","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1190160/236d616dc6518d743846a3aa2377475e4f12b60a.jpg"}],"total":23},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1190160?t=1695457269","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1190160/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1695457269","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1190160/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1695457269","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1190160/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1695457269","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Who we are</h1><p>We are 4 students from Berlin and LIT is our first game! We spent our spare time for the past 2 years making it  and we are really happy to finally publish it on Steam. Thanks for your interest :-).<br><br>Malte, Kala, Julian, Carolin</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Set in an era when electricity wasn\u2019t a thing and nothing but imaginations of great inventors that set the world in motion, LIT test your own inner engineer and lets you discover the joy of experimenting with light at first hand.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1190160/extras/17d77e0dacb33ac0f8501a841b2d6ccf.poster.avif?t=1695457269\" width=736 height=148 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1190160/extras/17d77e0dacb33ac0f8501a841b2d6ccf.webm?t=1695457269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1190160/extras/17d77e0dacb33ac0f8501a841b2d6ccf.mp4?t=1695457269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1190160/extras/db54f9c73b1ef83d45f3346a1759a0eb.webp?t=1695457269\" width=633 height=50 /></span><br>The behaviour of light in LIT is physically accurate. That said, the amazing light paths you are going to build in LIT are possible but extremely hard to reproduce in real life. Our game gives you the opportunity to set up mirrors and glass pieces to reflect and refract a light beam as you wish, with just few clicks of the mouse.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1190160/extras/6fc092e9295c91d5c6b1c827805c7cf7.webp?t=1695457269\" width=633 height=50 /></span><br>Our puzzles are open-ended. We give you the rules and the tools, you show us how to solve the problem. We assigned a number of possible solutions to each level but don\u2019t let those numbers fool you -  we\u2019re only waiting for the players to find solutions we haven't thought of.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1190160/extras/da1c0bc7453f2aa0d9dc495ab470d323.webp?t=1695457269\" width=633 height=50 /></span><br>Visuals threading on the thin line between cartoony and realistic. Good pacing. Relaxing music, which lets you zone in. All of that creates a unique, mysterious but warm atmosphere.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1190160/extras/cb5e402ec5a9e29820a8a30abaa659fa.poster.avif?t=1695457269\" width=736 height=148 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1190160/extras/cb5e402ec5a9e29820a8a30abaa659fa.webm?t=1695457269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1190160/extras/cb5e402ec5a9e29820a8a30abaa659fa.mp4?t=1695457269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1190160/extras/259229fdf3c93f5324a421f94aa04505.webp?t=1695457269\" width=633 height=50 /></span><br>When light hits a mirror and it reflects, it hits glass and it bends. That\u2019s all. And yet, it offers thousands of possibilities, which means each of our levels is different and unique.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1190160/extras/225a006ca581bf0521af623081891fad.webp?t=1695457269\" width=633 height=50 /></span><br>LIT is extremely intuitive. Testing the game on multiple gaming events proved that it works for all age groups and all types of players. You want to find every solution and beyond? Searching for a game for your 5-year-old? Or maybe you\u2019re trying to introduce your mum to gaming? Controller player or mouse and keyboard type, LIT\u2019s got you covered.","developers":["Copperglass"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1190160/header.jpg?t=1695457269","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"